# Line endings (plan 20261121-1452/03).
#
# The app is developed on Windows and deployed on Linux (Raspberry Pi). Shell
# scripts and container/config files MUST be LF in the working tree as well as
# in the blobs: a CRLF `#!/usr/bin/env bash` fails with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" when the tree is copied to the Pi
# (git clone is fine either way — these rules keep every checkout identical).
#
# Checked with: git ls-files --eol deploy/

*.sh        text eol=lf
*.env*      text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
